('5b88771dcc32427ed1c02dfc24c15cfa','Loop berjalan 14 kali (sel pertama dikurangi 1 tiap putaran) dan setiap putaran menambah 3 ke sel kedua. Pointer berakhir di sel kedua.','The loop runs 14 times (the first cell drops by 1 each pass) and every pass adds 3 to the second cell. The pointer ends on the second cell.'),
