('3f912ec5acd4a482b8b253137e1b11b9','Rentang opcode: 50-57 push, 58-5F pop, 40-47 inc, 48-4F dec; urutan register: eax, ecx, edx, ebx, esp, ebp, esi, edi. Kurangi byte pertama dengan awal rentang untuk mendapat nomor register. Byte B8 + angka 32-bit berarti mov eax, nilai.','Opcode ranges: 50-57 push, 58-5F pop, 40-47 inc, 48-4F dec; register order: eax, ecx, edx, ebx, esp, ebp, esi, edi. Subtract the range start from the first byte to get the register number. Byte B8 + a 32-bit number means mov eax, value.'),
