('161c11192b0fe7db00b2a1da263cace8','Loop berjalan 11 kali (sel pertama dikurangi 1 tiap putaran) dan setiap putaran menambah 3 ke sel kedua. Pointer berakhir di sel kedua.','The loop runs 11 times (the first cell drops by 1 each pass) and every pass adds 3 to the second cell. The pointer ends on the second cell.'),
